们的惊呼声……突然，天迹划过十道流光，飞快的冲到殿内，满脸的震惊和喜悦，一位老者不停地颤抖，神情激动，其余的九人同样的姿势，同样的表情，都仰头注视着同一个地方，只见那里是一道巨大的彩色墙壁，像翡翠一样，好像有生命在其中，不停地运转着，彩色的墙壁之前从右到左悬浮着好几个两米见方一尺厚的玉牌，每个上边都有奇怪的图形，多数都是红色的，鲜红欲滴的，上边有白色的烟雾缠绕着，只有三个金色的，看上去好像比红色的更圣洁，更蕴含力量。而此时，最左边的金色玉牌旁边，正有大量的能量形成着，不断从后边的彩色墙壁上吸收着什么，两者之间形成了一条纽带，渐渐的也变成一块巨大的玉牌，刹那间，光芒万丈，冲破云霄，天空中的云不知何时变成了巨龙的模样，一直在大殿上方盘旋奔腾，仿佛能听见低沉的龙吟声，向四面八方昭告着什么。十位老者眼睛都不敢眨，见证这神圣的一刻，终于，不知过了多久，光芒逐渐停歇，天上的红云也慢慢消散，晃动坍塌的大殿也停止摇晃，只有彩色墙壁上新形成了一块玉牌，正散发这金光。“天哪，这…这…”一个微胖的老者忍不住惊呼。“那是，那是，是我眼睛花了吗？”一个胖老头滑稽的揉揉眼睛，不敢相信。“金色，是金色啊！”一个仙风道骨的老者喃喃低语。“没错，没错，快，快，王上，快禀报王上…”“啊，对，小殿下诞生了，快禀告王上…”“不行，等不及了，我们赶紧想办法，一定要尽快将小殿下寻回……”“对啊，看我都激动地忘了，寻回，寻回，迟了就晚了…”“也不知道在哪个界面，怎么办？怎么办？”十位老者一时乱了阵脚，急得团团转，险些撞在一起。且说战轻狂这边，终于生下来了，她无神的望着天，淡淡的笑了，爬到泉边，喝了几口水，总算是恢复了力气，转身抱起孩子，她满心的欢喜，因此忽略了刚生下来的孩子根本一声都没哭。是个男孩呢！她有儿子了，将婴儿抱到泉边，仔细的给他清洗干净，忍不住亲了好几下。瞧瞧她的儿子长得多漂亮，白嫩嫩的，大大的眼睛，黝黑的瞳孔，正眼都不眨的看着自己呢！高耸的小鼻子，红润的唇，长大了肯定能迷倒万千少女。这样漂亮的孩子的她的儿子呢！“妈妈的宝宝，真漂亮，妈妈给个香香，么么。”忍不住的战轻狂又亲了两下，肉乎乎，软糯糯的，直到手上的触感仍旧是光溜溜的，她才想起来还没给他的宝贝儿子穿衣服呢。她将衣服穿好，又吃了两个生命果，现在她才发现这果子的一个妙用，那就是身体一下子就恢复到原来的样子，连坐月子都省了。闪身到山洞里，战轻狂将早就准备好的上好云锦制成的小衣服给她的宝贝儿子穿上，抱在怀里展示给另两个生物看。小豹子兴奋的直转圈，打量着这个和她有相同气息的，就连母豹子也给面子的多看了她好几眼。“妈妈的宝宝要叫什么名字呢？妈妈要给你想个好听的名字，恩，曾经有个很厉害的帝王叫康熙，就从他的名字里取个玄吧，妈妈希望你能站在最顶端，睥睨天下，还希望你能有个明亮耀眼的人生，熠熠生辉就不错，就叫战玄熠吧！好不好？”战轻狂很满意这个名字，笑呵呵的征求她宝贝儿子的意见，看着他圆溜溜的大眼睛看着自己，她才想到，儿子到现在都没哭，也不知道他饿不饿。揉了揉胸部，结果她失望的发现，她真的没有奶，看来当初她找个“奶妈”就对了。将儿子抱到母豹子的身边，引起它的警惕。“别紧张，别紧张，我儿子饿了，你帮我喂喂，好不好？”小心让它躺下，她不断的安抚着，才将儿子放在它的腹部，并且时刻注意着，不让母豹子有机会伤害他。看见母豹子配合的喂着儿子，她抚摸它的下颚，听见呼噜呼噜的声音，也渐渐放下心来。等到儿子吃饱了，又抱在怀里，轻轻的拍哄着，“熠儿快快长大，妈妈好带着你去闯荡世界，好不好，你什么时候会叫妈妈呢？”想到毕竟是异世界，没有妈妈这个称呼，未免以后一起别人注意，她还是入乡随俗吧！“不是妈妈，是娘亲，娘亲的熠儿快长大哦！”轻轻的摇晃着胳膊，和那圆溜溜的大眼睛撞上，心中是满满的幸福。正享受着温馨的时刻，忽然，怀里的宝宝不干了，不停地扭动着身体，“熠儿怎么了？”看他抓住自己戴着戒指的手，战轻狂反应过来了，“熠儿是想回空间吗？”眨眼的功夫，母子俩就回到生命空间了，看着儿子一个劲儿的往泉水方向使劲儿，她抱着它走到泉边，却没想到，小人儿一蹬腿从她的怀中掉落在泉水里，这可把她吓坏了，刚想跳下去救他，就发现小人儿正美滋滋的浮在泉水上面，样子很是惬意。战轻狂这才松了一口气，想到儿子从娘胎里就不断吸收生命元素，想必他很喜欢吧！而且，看他也没什么危险的样子，这才放下心来。等他泡在里边好几个时辰也没见他沉下去，这才出现在山洞里，准备收拾一下。刚出来，她就发现总能看见的两只豹子不见了，难道是不想帮她喂儿子，所以，“奶妈”带着孩子跑了？不会吧！走出山洞，她将所有可能的地方都找了，没有任何发现。垂头丧气的往回走，却听到有人的说话声，抱着看热闹的心态，她打算去看看。两拨人马，一边是受伤严重的五个人，另一边是趾高气扬的八个人。最让人受不了的是，她找到她家“奶妈”了，可是，谁来告诉她，这是怎么一回事，她家奶妈怎么躺在血泊里了？“我告诉你们，不要嚣张，就算我们全都死在这，可是天理昭彰，报应不爽，你们也不会有好下场的。”受伤严重的一个大汉捂着伤口，恨恨的说。“哈哈哈，报应？你到阎王爷那里去说吧！”对面好像是领头的人咆哮着。就在这时，战轻狂不分场合的插了句，“你们谁能说说这是发生什么事了吗？”两方人马都向这边看来，什么时候这里多了一个人，他们怎么没发现，是敌是友？“都聋了，没听到？和我说说怎么回事，还有这两只豹子，谁杀的？”见没人理她，战轻狂沉了脸。“你不要多管闲事，否则，就将你的小命留在这吧！”人数多的人那边又有人说话了。“你，说说，怎么回事？”指了指一个受伤的小姑娘，战轻狂语气不耐，看似不经意的捡起一把地上的短刀。小姑娘被那阴冷的视线吓了一跳，赶紧说出事情的经过，“我们是和老师来这里招生的，本来在林子里休息，我看见一只小豹子，见它一点都不凶，就和它一起玩，可是，森罗学院的林娇娇想抢小豹子，我不给，他们就和我们打起来了，还暗算我们，硬是把小豹子抢了过去，小豹子不愿意，他们就将小豹子摔死了，后来，大豹子来了，就和他们拼命，也被他们打死了…”说道这，小姑娘伤心的哭了。而战轻狂眼中的风暴也越来越多，当初一时心软救了它们，相处两个月，也是有些感情的，小豹子顽皮，母豹子傲娇，和它们相处还是很有意思的，而且她的儿子刚出生，还要母豹子的喂养，现在，却被杀了？“就是你们，杀了我家奶妈？”刀尖一指，战轻狂满身煞气。所有人都被她这话弄得一愣，奶妈？什么跟什么啊？不过，还是看得出来她的敌意的。“你在说什么，什么奶妈？识相的快滚，别再这里多管闲事。”领头的人不自觉的握紧手中的武器。“就是它们，你们杀的？”努努嘴，战轻狂问得是那两只豹子。被她的杀气压的喘不过起来，其中一个小喽啰嚣张的说，“是我们杀的，你能怎样？”“是你们杀的，那就好办了。”话毕，将短刀握在手里，一个冲刺就划破将刚才嚣张少年的喉咙，徒留他捂着喉咙，瞪大双眼。大家都被她的动作惊住了，眨眼之间，一条人命就这样没了，他们甚至都没看见她是怎么出手的。然而就在他们怔愣的同时，战轻狂又果断的收割了三条人命。躲过一个攻击，战轻狂顺势而上，紧贴敌人的背部，刀刃划过他的脖子，喷了满地的血。剩下的三人你看看我，我看看你，此时才知道怕了，难道他们惹上修武强者了？惜命的三人赶紧结印，脚下的灵力阵法闪现，一个大灵师，两个灵师，没等他们准备好，战轻狂就飞速冲到他们面前，结束的他们的生命，硬碰硬？她战轻狂从不做自不量力的事，现在身体里一丝灵力都没有，怎么能光明正大的打，只有出其不意，赢了才是王道！受伤的五人只觉得从来没见过这样的场面，就这么短的时间里，把重伤他们的人杀了，那动作快，狠，准，干净利落，直叫他们心服口服。将刀扔了，战轻狂将小豹子抱起来，放到母豹子身边，以后再也看不到它们了，把母豹子失去光泽的眼睛合上，她叹了口气。早就等在身边的陈立见她站起身来，赶紧抱拳，“在下云舒学院导师陈立，多谢姑娘救命之恩。”“恩，不用，本来也不是为了救你们。”战轻狂摆摆手，表示她不在意。“不管是因为什么，姑娘救了我们也是事实，在下看姑娘应该是修武者吧！正好这次在下负责云舒学院的招生，希望你能加入我们云舒学院。”说着递给她一张入院名额。云舒学院？没听过，不过，去看看也无妨，毕竟她要是想变强，有正统的教学和指导老师，总比自己摸索强。“有时间的话，我会去。”将入院名额抽走，战轻狂挥挥手走了，只留给大家一个娇小却不能让人小觑的背影。“导师，你怎么就将名额给她了，多少人梦寐以求的机会就这样给她了？”一个冲动的少年不满的嘟囔。“去，你知道什么，这少女不简单啊！且不说她的身手不一般，就是心性也不是一般人可比的，对待敌人绝不手软，可是对待自己人却是赤胆之心。”“导师，哪里有自己人啊？我们和她也不认识…”“笨呐，没看见她是怎么给她家奶妈报仇的？”“什么奶妈？导师，我怎么不明白……”师生五人相互搀扶，越走越远……", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/hundanmohouxiaozhangniangqing/8.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 8 When she was nine months old, Zhan Qingkuang was getting weaker and weaker. Every time she provided spiritual power to her baby, it was like fighting a battle, but she felt very satisfied. She was about to meet her baby. The two leopards were used to her appearing and disappearing. Seeing her come out, the little leopard happily came over and rubbed her legs. \"Okay, okay.\" After touching it, Zhan Qingkuang looked at the female leopard. It is worth mentioning that the female leopard she rescued really had a personality. She rescued it two months ago and bandaged its wounds. However, it turned out to be indifferent to her savior. Just like now, when she saw her, she glanced at her and turned her head back arrogantly, her tail wagging impatiently. Hey, you have personality! She likes it. After cooking a pot of delicious vegetable broth, she finished eating, looked at the sunset, blew in the wind, and felt that life was so beautiful. Touching her belly, her baby must be thinking the same thing. Suddenly, I felt a little sinking feeling in my stomach. Could it be that I was about to give birth? Thinking of this, she quickly returned to the life space, took off her clothes and pants, and prepared to give birth. The pain in her stomach became more and more painful. Zhan Qingkuang bit her lips until she had teeth marks, but the child still could not come out. At this moment, the pain intensified, and all the life elements were distorted. The originally evenly distributed life elements continued to converge with golden light, gradually forming a golden light pillar, which became thicker and thicker, and then poured into her body crazily. \"Ah\" the pain came, as if an atomic bomb exploded in the body. The birth was already very painful, but now it was worse, what kind of fate was she in! She could see the bulging veins through her skin. If anyone saw her like this, they would turn around and run away in fear. \"Well...ah...\" The child in her belly was absorbing the spiritual energy gathered in her body, making it unbearable for her. \"Baby, be good...come out quickly...Mom, hurry up, I can't hold on anymore...\" She kept exerting force, Zhan Qingkuang took deep breaths again and again, and when she exerted more force, her body was stretched to the point of bursting, but she persisted with her amazing willpower, repeating the same action mechanically. Suddenly there was a tearing pain down below. Zhan Qingkuang gritted his teeth and kept exerting force. His nails dug deeply into the soil. He didn't even care about the bleeding. He held his head high and took a last deep breath to give birth to the child. At the same time, mysterious heavenly traces were heard, dragons roared and tigers roared, auspicious clouds rolled in the sky, and red and gold illuminated the entire heavenly trace. In the magnificent hall, rumbling sounds were heard, tiles continued to fall, and dust was thrown up. It was like an earthquake, and everyone could not stand still. , kept shaking, and they were all stunned by this vision. There were noises, the sound of broken jade, the sound of tea cups and candlesticks falling, and people's exclamations... Suddenly, ten streaks of light streaked across the sky, and they rushed into the hall quickly. His face was full of shock and joy, and an old man kept trembling. Shaking, with excited expressions, the other nine people had the same posture and the same expression, all looking up at the same place. They saw there was a huge colorful wall, like emerald, as if there was life in it, constantly running, the colorful wall from right to front There are several jade tablets two meters square and one foot thick floating on the left, each with strange graphics on them, most of them are red, bright red, with white smoke lingering on them. There are only three golden ones, which seem to be more holy and contain more power than the red ones. At this time, a large amount of energy was being formed next to the golden jade tablet on the far left, which was constantly absorbing something from the colorful wall behind. A bond was formed between the two, and gradually it turned into a huge jade tablet. In an instant, the light was shining, breaking through the sky. The clouds in the sky turned into the shape of a giant dragon at some point, and kept circling and galloping above the hall. It seemed that a low dragon roar could be heard, announcing something in all directions. The ten old men did not dare to blink, witnessing this sacred moment. Finally, after an unknown amount of time, the light gradually stopped, the red clouds in the sky slowly dissipated, and the swaying and collapsed hall stopped shaking. Only a newly formed jade plaque on the colorful wall was emitting this golden light. \"Oh my god, this... this...\" A slightly fat old man couldn't help but exclaimed. \"That's it, that's it, is my eyes blurred?\" A fat old man rubbed his eyes funny, not believing it. \"Golden, it's golden!\" A fairy-like old man murmured. \"That's right, that's right, come on, come on, Your Majesty, report to Your Majesty quickly...\" \"Ah, yes, His Highness is born, please report to Your Majesty...\" \"No, I can't wait any longer. We must find a way to find His Majesty as soon as possible...\" \"Yeah, I was so excited that I forgot about it. Find it, find it, it's too late...\" \"I don't know which interface it is on, what should I do?\" The ten old men were confused for a while, running around in a hurry, and almost collided with each other. Speaking of Zhan Qingkuang's side, she finally gave birth. She looked at the sky blankly, smiled faintly, climbed to the edge of the spring, drank some water, and finally regained her strength. She turned around and picked up the baby. She was so happy that she ignored that the newborn baby didn't cry at all. It's a boy! She had a son. She took the baby to the spring, cleaned him carefully, and couldn't help but kiss him several times. Look how beautiful her son is, white and tender, with big eyes and dark pupils, looking at her without blinking! With her tall little nose and red lips, she will surely charm thousands of girls when she grows up. Such a beautiful child of her son! \"Mom's baby, it's so beautiful. Mom, give it a nice scent, okay.\" Zhan Qingkuang couldn't help but kiss her twice more. It was fleshy, soft and waxy. It wasn't until her hands were still smooth to the touch that she remembered that she hadn't dressed her precious son yet. She put on her clothes and ate two more Life Fruits. Only now did she discover a magical effect of this fruit, that is, her body instantly returned to its original state.", "title_en": "Chapter 8"}